---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import markLight from '../../assets/brand/vp-mark-light.png';
---

<section data-screen-label="Home — hero" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0B2F6B;padding:clamp(38px,5.6cqi,88px) clamp(18px,4cqi,64px) clamp(18px,2.2cqi,30px)">
  <Image src={markLight} alt="" aria-hidden="true" width={344} height={242} loading="eager" decoding="async" style="height:auto;position:absolute;right:-6cqi;top:18%;width:44cqi;max-width:none;opacity:.1;pointer-events:none" />
  <div style="position:relative;display:flex;gap:clamp(28px,4cqi,64px);align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <div data-vp-herotext="1" style="flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;max-width:calc(100% - min(40cqi,460px));padding-bottom:clamp(18px,3cqi,48px)">
      <h1 style="margin: clamp(18px,2.4cqi,32px) 0 0; max-width: 30ch; font-family: Satoshi,Inter,sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(32px,4.3cqi,62px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.04em; color: #F8FAFC; text-wrap: balance; animation: vpRise .9s .12s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; text-align: left">Et si de <span style="color: rgb(245, 130, 32);">nouveaux chantiers</span> venaient à vous, pendant que vos demandes et votre administratif se gèrent <span style="color: rgb(245, 130, 32);">tout seuls</span> ?</h1>
      <p style="margin:clamp(22px,2.8cqi,36px) 0 0;max-width:52ch;font-size:clamp(15px,1.25cqi,16.5px);line-height:1.68;color:#CBD5E1;text-wrap:pretty;animation:vpRise .9s .26s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both">Une meilleure visibilité sur Google pour être trouvé, une réceptionniste qui répond à tous vos appels, mails et messages, et un outil de gestion sur mesure pour les entreprises du BTP.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(18px,2.4cqi,34px);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:clamp(24px,3cqi,40px);animation:vpRise .9s .38s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both">
        <a class="h-ee0d60 rb" href="/contact/" data-cta="1" style="flex:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#F58220;color:#0F172A;border:none;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 28px;min-height:60px;box-sizing:border-box;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font-family:inherit;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(245,130,32,.25);transition:background .28s ease,box-shadow .28s ease,transform .28s ease">
          <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-width:0">
            <span style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;line-height:1.15;min-width:0">
              <span style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; text-align: center">On en discute </span>
              <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0F172A">30 min · gratuit</span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a class="h-780af8" href="#leviers" style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#F8FAFC;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.55);padding-bottom:3px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:color .25s ease,border-color .25s ease" data-on-click="scrollLevers">Découvrir les 3 leviers →</a>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 20px;margin-top:16px;font-size:12.5px;color:#CBD5E1;animation:vpRise .9s .44s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both">
        <span>✓ 30 min en visio</span>
        <span>✓ Sans engagement</span>
        <span>✓ Réponse sous 24h</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-vp-mascot="1" style="position:absolute;right:clamp(0px,3cqi,48px);bottom:calc(-1 * clamp(18px,2.2cqi,30px));height:calc(100% + clamp(18px,2.2cqi,30px) + clamp(10px,1.6cqi,24px));display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:flex-end;pointer-events:none">
      <div style="position:relative;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:flex-end">
        <div style="position:relative;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;animation:vpRise .9s .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both">
          <img src="/assets/vp-mascotte-pointe.webp" alt="Mascotte Vivo Partner qui pointe du doigt" width="480" height="839" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" style="display:block;height:100%;width:auto;max-width:min(40cqi,460px);object-fit:contain;object-position:bottom right;filter:drop-shadow(0 22px 30px rgba(2,8,22,.45))" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;margin-top:clamp(26px,3.4cqi,52px);padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.18);display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;animation:vpFade 1s .6s ease both">
    <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#F8FAFC">Automatise aujourd’hui. <span style="color:#F58220">Accélère demain.</span></span>
  </div>
</section>
